					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "SORT\nThe sort node will sort the incomming collection. The mode can be set to ascending or descending in the inspector. The indices outlet outputs the indices of the collection (also sorted)\n\nExample A: The Sort node is used to sort a random array of values. By doing this we can achieve randomness that still maintains some sort of order.\n\n\n"
					}
				},
